{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983210/extras/eb641c056aba7fd49179eb45b8d2ea52.poster.avif?t=1759158100\" width=620 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983210/extras/eb641c056aba7fd49179eb45b8d2ea52.webm?t=1759158100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983210/extras/ad80de9a89404a8fb0ea3a526dcad04c.avif?t=1759158100\" width=616 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Memories with You</strong> is the final installment in the &quot;to You&quot; series of visual novels. Discover what ultimately happens to the series' main characters, Harley and Alicia, and dive into another wild romantic adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983210/extras/182698b7d37bbf3a36c7e2fd8d5e6884.webp?t=1759158100\" width=300 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983210/extras/d7c338c1ec7cbbb7a223e57404d21d9f.avif?t=1759158100\" width=641 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The protagonist, whose life is suddenly on the edge due to a devastating diagnosis, spends his final days in a bar, trying to drown his pain in alcohol and memories. His youth was filled with missed opportunities, unexpressed emotions, and shattered hopes. But everything changes when a mysterious girl in a sexy circus outfit sits down beside him. She calls herself Harley\u2014a charismatic and enigmatic figure who offers the protagonist a chance to make things right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You\u2019ll embark on a series of stories experienced by the main character, overcome the condition inflicted upon you by Harley, and finally find the love of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983210/extras/7fbae7ed2677e4950eb8270cd6b346a0.avif?t=1759158100\" width=1280 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983210/extras/182698b7d37bbf3a36c7e2fd8d5e6884.webp?t=1759158100\" width=300 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983210/extras/cd81fc93f9d7e73d8c6b484ff5a401e2.avif?t=1759158100\" width=626 height=742 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983210/extras/182698b7d37bbf3a36c7e2fd8d5e6884.webp?t=1759158100\" width=300 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_im